hadiths[51]{hadithnumber,text}:
"4222","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that the Messenger of Allah said:""There is no fara' and no' Atirah"
"4223","It was narrated that Abu Hurairah that:the Messenger of Allah forbade Fara' and 'Atirah"
"4224","Mikhnaf bin Sulaim said:""While we were standing with the Messenger of Allah at 'Arafat"
"4225","Amr bin Shu'aib bin Muhammad bin 'Abdullah bin 'Amr (narrated) that his father and Zaid bin Aslam said:""O Messenger of Allah! (What about) the Fara'?"" He said: ""It is a duty"
"4226","It was narrated that Yahya bin Zurarah bin Karim bin Al-Harith bin 'Amr Al-Bahili said:""I heard my father say"
"4227","Yahya bin Zurarah As-Sahmi said:""My father narrated to me from his grandfather"
"4228","It was narrated that Nubaishah said:""It was said to the prophet: 'During the Jahiliyyah we used to offer the 'Atirah.' He said: 'Slaughter for the sake of Allah"
"4229","It was narrated that Nubaishah said:""A man called out while he was in Mina and said: 'O Messenger of Allah"
"4230","It was narrated from Nubaishah"
"4231","It was narrated that Nubaishah said:""A man called out to the Prophet and said: 'We used to sacrifice the 'Atirah - i.e."
"4232","It was narrated that Nubaishah Al-Hudhaili said:""A man said: 'O Messenger of Allah"
"4233","It was narrated that Abu Razin Laqit bin 'Amir Al-Uqaili said:""I said: 'O Messenger of Allah"
"4234","It was narrated from Ibn 'Abbas"
"4235","It was narrated that Ibn 'Abbas said:""The Messenger of Allah passed by a dead sheep that he had given to a freed slave woman of Maimunah"
"4236","Ibn'Abbas said:""The Messenger of Allah saw a dead sheep that belonged to the freed slave woman of Maimunah"
"4237","It was narrated from Ibn 'Abbas:""Maimunah told me that a sheep died"
"4238","Ibn 'Abbas said:""The Prophet passed by a sheep belonging to Maimunah that had died and said: 'Why don't you take its skin and tan it and make use of it'?"
"4239","Ibn 'Abbas said:""The Prophet passed by a dead sheep and said: 'Why don't you make use of its skin'?"
"4240","It was narrated that Sawdah"
"4241","It was narrated that Ibn 'Abbas said:""The Messenger of Allah said: 'Any skin that is tanned has been purified"
"4242","It was narrated from Ibn Wa'lah that he asked Ibn 'Abbas:""We are attacking the Maghrib"
"4243","It was narrated from Salamah bin Al-Muhabbaq that:during the campaign of Tabuk"
"4244","It was narrated that 'Aishah said:""The Prophet was asked about the hides of dead animals."" He said: ""Tanning it purifies it"
"4245","It was narrated that 'Aishah said:""The Messenger of Allah was asked about the hides of dead animals."" He said: ""Tanning it purifies it"
"4246","It was narrated from 'Aishah that the Prophet said:""The dead animal is purified by tanning it"
"4247","It was narrated that 'Aishah said:""The Prophet said: 'The dead animal is purified by tanning it"
"4248","It was narrated from Maimunah"
"4249","It was narrated that 'Abdullah bin 'Ukaim said:""The letter of the Messenger of Allah was read to us when I was a young boy: 'Do not make use of the skins and sinew of dead animals"
"4250","It was narrated that'Abdullah bin 'Ukaim said:""The Messenger of Allah wrote to us: 'Do not make use of the skins and sinew of dead animals"
"4251","It was narrated that 'Abdullah bin 'Ukaim said:""The Messenger of Allah wrote to Juhainah: 'Do not make use of the skin and sinew of dead animals.""' (Hasan) Abu 'Abdur-Rahman )An-Nasa'i) said: The most correct about this topic"
"4252","It was narrated from 'Aishah that:the Messenger of Allah ordered that the hides of dead animals be made use of if they had been tanned. (Daif)"
"4253","It was narrated from Abu Al-Malih"
"4254","It was narrated that Al-Miqdam bin Ma di Karib said:""The Messenger of Allah forbade silk"
"4255","It was narrated that Khalid said:""Al-Miqdam bin Madikarib came to visit Muawiyah and said to him: I adjure you by Allah"
"4256","It was narraterd from Jabir bin 'Abdullah that"
"4257","It was narrated that Ibn'Abbas said:""It reached 'Umar that Samurah had sold some wine"
"4258","It was narrated from Ibn 'Abbas"
"4259","It was narrated from Ibn' Abbas"
"4260","It was narrated from Ibn' Abbas"
"4261","Ibn ' Abbas said:"" I heard Sa'eed bin Jubair say: 'The Messenger of Allah passed by a dead goat and said: ""Why didn't the owners of this sheep makes use of its skin?"
"4262","It was narrated from Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri that the Prophet said:""If a fly falls into the vessel of one of you"
"4263","It was narrated from 'Adiyy bin Hatim that:he asked the Messenger of Allah about hunting. He said: ""When you release your dog"
"4264","It was narrated that `Adiyy bin Abi Hatim said:""I asked the Messenger of Allah about hunting with a Mi`rad. He said: 'If you strike (the game) with its sharp point"
"4265","It was Narrated from 'Adiyy bin Hatim the he asked the Messenger of Allah :""I release my trained dog and he catches (game)."" He said: ""If you release the trained dog and you say the name of Allah over him"
"4266","Abu Tha'labah Al-Khushani said:""I said: 'O Messenger of Allah"
"4267","It was narrated that 'Adiyy bin Hatim said:""I said: 'O Messenger of Allah"
"4268","It was narrated from 'Adiyy bin Hatim that he asked the Messenger of Allah about hunting and he said:""If you release your dog and other dogs over with you have not mentioned the name of Allah join him"
"4269","It was narrated that 'Adiyy bin Hatim said:""I asked the Messenger of Allah about dogs and he said: 'If you release your dog and say the name of Allah"
"4270","It was narrated from Ash-Sha bi that; ""Adiyy bin Hatim who was neighbor"
"4271","It was narrated from 'Adiyy bin Hatim:A similar report was narrated from 'Adiyy bin Hatim"
"4272","It was narrated that 'Adiyy bin Hatim said:""I asked the Messenger of Allah: 'I release my dog. He said: 'If you release your dog and mention the name of Allah"